,"text":"\"His Eyes, All of Them\" by Margaret Killjoy. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 19 Sep 2021."}},{"id":"his-eyes-all-them-2021-09-17-e13","era":null,"summary":"Malynn explains that Stickfingers is a hearth spirit of this place and cannot be sent away; Vadrik realizes he was summoned to protect, not to kill.","participants":["malynn","vadrik","old-stickfingers"],"location":"lambholt","importance":"major","page":"stories/his-eyes-all-them-2021-09-17","order":754,"story_date":"2021-09-19","storyline":"Innistrad: Crimson Vow","source":"wizards","paragraph":187,"quote":"\"So he was summoned, not to kill, but to protect?\"","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/his-eyes-all-them-2021-09-17#:~:text=%22So%20he%20was%20summoned%2C,kill%2C%20but%20to%20protect%3F%22","citation":{"source":"wizards","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"His Eyes, All of Them","series":"Magic Story","authors":["Margaret Killjoy"],"date":"2021-09-19","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/his-eyes-all-them-2021-09-17","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/his-eyes-all-them-2021-09-17#:~:text=%22So%20he%20was%20summoned%2C,kill%2C%20but%20to%20protect%3F%22","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"His Eyes, All of Them\" by Margaret Killjoy. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 19 Sep 2021."}},{"id":"his-eyes-all-them-2021-09-17-e14","era":null,"summary":"Vadrik works out that Arinos did not finish the summoning, so Stickfingers killed intruders on the old estate's land; Rem holds the monster back and Vadrik heals him.","participants":["vadrik","ariosa","rem-karolus","old-stickfingers"],"location":"lambholt","importance":"minor","page":"stories/his-eyes-all-them-2021-09-17","order":754,"story_date":"2021-09-19","storyline":"Innistrad: Crimson Vow","source":"wizards","paragraph":197,"quote":"Killed Arinos as an intruder on his own land.","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/his-eyes-all-them-2021-09-17#:~:t